  f. use the Artifact or its results to train or improve a commercial model or
     service.

Technical modifications that are strictly necessary to install, execute,
debug, or evaluate the Artifact are permitted only within the authorized
evaluation environment and may not be redistributed.

4. Confidentiality and access

The Artifact is supplied through access mechanisms authorized for the SBSeg
2026 artifact-evaluation process. Recipients must use reasonable safeguards to
prevent unauthorized access. Access credentials, if any, are personal and may
